<title>FRANCE: Saint-Louis nine month sales rises.</title>
<headline>Saint-Louis nine month sales rises.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>Turnover				    26,683  vs	  25,705</p>
<p>-- of which third quarter		8,416  vs	   8,099</p>
<p>NOTE - Saint-Louis gave the sales figure in the BALO official bulletin.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
